sequenceDiagram
    participant UserBrowser
    participant LeanFMServer
    UserBrowser->>LeanFMServer: WorkSubmitted
    loop repeat
    LeanFMServer->>UserBrowser: WorkCheckpointed
    UserBrowser->>LeanFMServer: WorkContinued
    end
    alt choice 1
    LeanFMServer->>UserBrowser: WorkCompleted
    else alternative
    LeanFMServer->>UserBrowser: WorkBlocked
    else alternative
    LeanFMServer->>UserBrowser: WorkNeedsDecision
    else alternative
    UserBrowser->>LeanFMServer: WorkCancelRequested
    LeanFMServer->>UserBrowser: WorkCancelled
    else alternative
    LeanFMServer->>UserBrowser: WorkCheckpointed
    UserBrowser->>LeanFMServer: WorkCancelRequested
    LeanFMServer->>UserBrowser: WorkCancelled
    end